### Test the Data Crunch Agent with sample CSV
POST http://localhost:8088/responses
Content-Type: application/json

{"input": "Analyze this CSV data:\nendpoint,response_ms,status_code\n/api/users,145,200\n/api/orders,1847,500\n/api/users,132,200\n/api/products,156,200\n/api/orders,2103,500"}

### Test with simple numeric data
POST http://localhost:8088/responses
Content-Type: application/json

{"input": "Analyze this data:\nvalue\n10\n12\n11\n13\n50\n12\n11\n10\n14\n13"}

### Test with sensor data
POST http://localhost:8088/responses
Content-Type: application/json

{"input": "Analyze this CSV:\nsensor_id,temperature_c\nsensor-A,21.3\nsensor-A,22.0\nsensor-B,21.5\nsensor-B,38.9\nsensor-B,41.2\nsensor-C,21.1\nsensor-C,24.3"}

### ─── Deployed Testing (Microsoft Foundry) ───

# Replace with your Foundry project endpoint from setup.ps1 output
@foundryEndpoint = https://your-project.services.ai.azure.com

# Get a token: az account get-access-token --resource https://cognitiveservices.azure.com --query accessToken -o tsv
@token = <your-token>

### Test deployed agent — data analysis
POST {{foundryEndpoint}}/agents/responses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"input": "Analyze this CSV data:\nendpoint,response_ms,status_code\n/api/users,145,200\n/api/orders,1847,500\n/api/users,132,200\n/api/products,156,200\n/api/orders,2103,500"}
